    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d541">

                <pb facs="0610" n="530" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg530"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Marquis of Lansdowne.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-24"><hi rendition="#italic">May 24,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Permit me to express our deep sympathy and sorrow at the death of Lord
                    Pauncefote. His Majesty’s Government have lost a most able and faithful servant,
                    and this country a valued friend.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
